  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Mole Digger: Watch Game",
      "description": "Draw your route, claim territory, and keep animals away from your trail! Mole Digger is an offline game for iPhone and Apple Watch that combines route planning, quick reactions, and timed challenges.\n\nSWIPE, TAP, AND CLAIM LAND\nGuide your mole into open land, then reconnect your trail to claimed ground to capture an area. Only the largest open region remains; the other regions and their animals disappear. Watch each animal, choose your moment, and retreat along your trail when danger gets too close.\n\nTAKE ON 10 LEVELS\nEach level starts with 60 seconds and 3 lives. Clear all animals or reduce the open area to the target size to advance. A collision or timeout costs a life. Run out of lives and your challenge begins again at level 1.\n\nCATCH THE RED ANIMAL\nCapture the red animal for a chance to collect one random item per level. Shield, Freeze, Extra Time, Sprint, Slow, and Extra Life can help you recover. A Mystery Box may give you a helpful effect, or double the animals' number or speed.EARN COINS AND CHASE STARS\nLink captures together for coin combos of up to 3x. Finish quickly and keep more lives to earn up to three stars per level, with a bonus for your first three-star clear. Your coins and best star ratings are saved on the current device.\n\nPLAY ON YOUR PHONE OR WRIST\nIncludes the iPhone game and a companion Apple Watch app for short play sessions. Gameplay works offline, with pause and resume controls. Coins and best star ratings are stored separately on each device and do not sync. Leaving a game does not save a resumable round.\n\nCHOOSE FROM 9 LANGUAGES\nPlay in English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, French, German, or Italian. Menus, instructions, and prompts follow your preferred app or device language, with English as the fallback for unsupported languages.\n\nStart with one patch of land and see how far you can go!",
      "releaseNotes": "Mole Digger gets a fresh storybook forest look!\n\n• Meet the mole in a leaf hat on a redesigned home screen with forest artwork, wooden signs, and a golden Start button.\n• Enjoy a grassy board, warm yellow borders, and a clear progress bar that keeps level goals in view.\n• Discover matching Help, Pause, and Results panels, refined layouts for small screens, and sharper text and graphics on iPhone.\n• Improved support for 9 languages on iPhone and Apple Watch, with localized menus and short app names.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mole-digger-watch-game/id6792192188?uo=4",
